{"author": "pgaudet", "body": "Dear all, \n\nGO:0030943 mitochondrion targeting sequence binding will be obsoleted, but since existing annotations are not only to the receptor, we cannot do a 'replaced_by' (see https://github.com/geneontology/go-ontology/issues/32108 for more details) \n\n\nAnnotations are here: https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1yKU7zrCk0GCK4J5LIF2LYJkf7JyeTu3lpLm0nuqESMM/edit?gid=0#gid=0\n\n- ComplexPortal 4\n- FlyBase 2\n- HGNC-UCL 1 - done\n- RGD 2\n- SGD 7\n- TAIR 2\n\n", "created_at": "2026-05-27T15:11:03Z", "key": "issue", "labels": ["annotation review", "direct_ann_to_list_of_terms"], "state": "open", "state_reason": null, "title": "Review annotations to GO:0030943 mitochondrion targeting sequence binding", "type": "issue", "updated_at": "2026-09-03T09:48:21Z"}
